        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YMGR-WLK, Walker Knob with Maguire Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Half-Round Walker Knob with Maguire Rose is a traditional styled knob that is available in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed functions. The Walker Knob with Maguire Rose is available in traditional color finishes. This traditional door hardware comes packaged with an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. It is also adjustable to fit standard door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Yale Expressions Walker Knob with Maguire Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Walker Knob with Maguire Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry has a Schlage C keyway.</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YMGR-WLK-specifications.pdf?v=1704262435\"><b>Yale YMGR-WLK Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. \r\nKnob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face). Package Includes: \r\n2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch \r\noperates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, \r\nstrike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. \r\nLatch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior knob engages privacy lock \r\non both knobs; emergency release hole is on exterior knob. Package Includes: \r\n2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Keyed:</b> Guarded latchbolt operated from outside by key; inside by knob. \r\nTurnbutton on the interior locks outside knob. Outside knob unlocks by key. \r\nComplete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Half-Round Walker Knob with Maguire Rose",
                "description": "The Half-Round Walker Knob with Maguire Rose is a traditional styled knob that is available in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed functions. The Walker Knob with Maguire Rose is available in traditional color finishes. This traditional door hardware comes packaged with an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. It is also adjustable to fit standard door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches.",
